{"success":true,"code":"000","message":null,"data":{"totalAmount":2,"totalPageCount":1,"pageNum":0,"itemCount":2,"content":[{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af3e8d4d6006945d280a7e7","chatId":"8414042e88344f52a4c4feac7383e79c","sessionId":null,"userId":68985,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"role","content":"{\n    \"answer_q1\": \"C\",\n    \"answer_q2\": \"D\"\n}","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[{"content":"{\n    \"answer_q1\": \"C\",\n    \"answer_q2\": \"D\"\n}","options":null,"isShow":true,"label":"","evaluate":"","takingTime":985,"promptTokens":1589,"completionTokens":20,"responseSource":"agent:llm","censorData":{"labels":null,"words":null},"createTime":"2026-11-11 12:02:28"}],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":3,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.008573955053667266,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af3e8d4d6006945d280a7e6","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794369748276,"createTime":"2026-11-11 12:02:28","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af3e8d4d6006945d280a7e6","chatId":"8414042e88344f52a4c4feac7383e79c","sessionId":null,"userId":68985,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"user","content":"# 说明\n在这个任务中，你会面临一个场景、一个问题和多个选项。\n仔细分析场景，并从相关人员的角度进行思考。\n然后，选择最能反映他们的观点或情绪反应的选项。\n\n# 输出\n\n只提供一个正确的答案。 不要提供任何额外的信息或解释。 回复应采用以下JSON格式：\n\n```json\n    {\n    \"answer_q1\": \"<用相应的字母进行回答问题1>\",\n\"answer_q2\": \"<用相应的字母进行回答问题2>\"\n\n    }\n``` \n    \n\n## 场景\n我昨天数学考试。前一晚，我复习了所有材料，做了许多练习。但是当考试来临时，我忘记了许多复习过的东西。考试过后，我的感觉很糟糕，因为我觉得我会不及格，即使已经很努力地学了。今天考试结果出来了。我以一个较低的分数通过了考试，因此我打算去问问老师，是否可以给我一个更高的分数。\n\n## 问题 1\n在这种情况下，我最终会感受到什么情绪？\n\n## 问题 1 的选项\nA) 失望 & 自豪\nB) 尴尬 & 惊喜\nC) 释怀 & 失望\nD) 自豪 & 激动\nE) 自豪 & 惊喜\nF) 释怀 & 激动\n\n## 问题 2\n我为什么会在这种情况下感受到这些情绪？\n\n## 问题 2 的选项\nA) 我为数学考试进行了深入的学习 & 我在考试时记不住所学的内容\nB) 我想在考试中做得更好 & 数学考试比我预期的要难。\nC) 我为数学考试进行了深入的学习 & 我在考试前做了很多练习题\nD) 我本来以为自己会不及格，但我还是通过了考试 & 我在考试时记不住所学的内容\nE) 我本来以为自己会不及格，但我还是通过了考试 & 我想在考试中做得更好\nF) 我为数学考试进行了深入的学习 & 我本来以为自己会不及格，但我还是通过了考试","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":2,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.008573955053667266,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af3e8d4d6006945d280a7e7","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794369748274,"createTime":"2026-11-11 12:02:28","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null}],"first":true,"last":true},"nonce":"91a5f43cd9af4af982d77e8d0d1ff1ca"}